  "description": "\"May I ask what your school days were like?\"\n\"There was nothing particularly problematic.\"\n\nChoi Yun-Ho was the perpetrator of terrible school violence. His blatant lie announces the beginning of it all. Twin brothers Lee Jin and Lee Jun were victims of his bullying, and they personally condemn Choi Yun-Ho, who was the perpetrator.\n\n\"I hope you don't give up halfway.\"\n\nIt's time for the roles of perpetrator and victim to reverse. What is each person's feelings about the actions taken in the name of revenge?\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
